sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as PM/Meeting host
  participant M as Meetily Desktop
  participant LG as Local AI Gateway
  participant NG as ngrok/Auth Tunnel
  participant API as QALY AiGateway/API
  participant DB as SQL Server
  participant LLM as AI API/Local Provider
  participant UI as QALY Meeting UI

  U->>M: Record meeting / generate transcript + summary
  M-->>U: Transcript + summary ready
  U->>LG: Click Sync to QALY or export file
  LG->>NG: POST /ai/meeting/sync with token
  NG->>API: Forward authenticated request
  API->>DB: Validate project, user, meeting permission
  API->>DB: Save meeting_transcripts + meeting_ai_summaries draft
  API->>LLM: Extract keywords/action_items/decisions JSON
  LLM-->>API: Structured draft output
  API->>DB: Save draft action items with confidence/source_quote
  API-->>UI: Show review screen
  U->>UI: Confirm selected action items
  UI->>API: Create tasks from confirmed action items
  API->>DB: Transaction create tasks + audit log
  Note over API,DB: AI output is never committed as official task without user confirmation.
